OL,3,GNEWSAKing and Queen join Highland games
OL,4,Afans at Braemar Gathering
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles and Queen Camilla have
OL,7,Fjoined cheering crowds watching
OL,8,FHighland games events at the annual
OL,9,FBraemar Gathering in Royal Deeside.
OL,11,FThe event, which draws spectators from
OL,12,Faround the world, is held on the first
OL,13,FSaturday of September every year and
OL,14,Fcoincides with the monarch's annual
OL,15,Fsummer holiday at nearby Balmoral.
OL,17,FAmong the events watched by the
OL,18,Fspectators were tug-of-war, caber
OL,19,Ftossing, hammer throwing, Highland
OL,20,Fdancing and a parade of pipe bands.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
